    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square of Joy is a challenging (but fair) climbing game. Controls are very simple; you can rotate and push yourself using one of (or all) 4 limbs, just like a regular human. But also just like in real life, there is Newtonian physics acting against you. With a little practice though, you will learn to use it to your advantage, to gain momentum and maintain the satisfying flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb up, reach the top, using nothing but your skill and will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with Steam friends and players from all over the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810160/extras/b6ea245fe2d94bfef2aa86426e86f307.avif?t=1734658888\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cWe choose to (...) do the (...) things, not because they are easy, but because they are hard\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John F. Kennedy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cIf you\u2019re tired of starting over, stop giving up\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shia LaBeouf<br><br><i>&quot;Why do I climb the mountain? (...) Because I'm in Love&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >William Shatner</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square of Joy is a challenging (but fair) climbing game. Controls are very simple; you can rotate and push yourself using one of (or all) 4 limbs, just like a regular human. But also just like in real life, there is Newtonian physics acting against you. With a little practice though, you will learn to use it to your advantage, to gain momentum and maintain the satisfying flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb up, reach the top, using nothing but your skill and will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with Steam friends and players from all over the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810160/extras/b6ea245fe2d94bfef2aa86426e86f307.avif?t=1734658888\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cWe choose to (...) do the (...) things, not because they are easy, but because they are hard\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John F. Kennedy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cIf you\u2019re tired of starting over, stop giving up\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shia LaBeouf<br><br><i>&quot;Why do I climb the mountain? (...) Because I'm in Love&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >William Shatner</p>",
    "short_description": "Climb up, reach the top, using nothing but your skill and will. Compete with steam friends and players from all over the world. Discover secrets along the way.",
